      "message": "fix(ui): keep the side drawing on a narrow tool library window\n\nThe review of #3943 found that on a 960 px screen the Side preview got\nless than the 216 px of dimension room and drew nothing. On a narrow\nwindow the rail now folds to 120 px and the preview keeps 250 px. The\nside view's dimension room gives way before the drawing: a thin border\nwith Dimensions off, and a room that shrinks in proportion so the drawing\nkeeps 96 px.\n\nPinned by the_side_view_draws_the_tool_on_a_960_px_screen and\nthe_side_view_without_dimensions_takes_their_room_on_a_960_px_screen.\n\nRefs #3897\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
